# A Luxel library scene — Apache-2.0. Grammar: library/README.md.
# What `add` does, at a glance: three colour boxes, red, green and blue,
# overlap into yellow, cyan, magenta and a white centre. Switch the top two
# to `lighten` and the overlaps take the brighter channel instead: no white.
S - Light Boxes
L color 3 3 16 16 normal 100 none fill 1
N Red
K ff0000
L color 13 3 16 16 add 100 none fill 1
N Green
K 00ff00
L color 8 13 16 16 add 100 none fill 1
N Blue
K 0000ff
